# Manifold level 10
# The gatehouse (stage 5n, decision 0031): the wall's second section, at five. A hall of pillars, two
# casters at its far end (their orbs are slow: step out of them) and two sentries; west, a room with the
# repeater, a closet behind it (a button); east, a room with the blue key and a caster. The blue door,
# north: a courtyard of crates, those who come when one walks in, the red key in its far corner. The red
# door: the way on. Drawn as a plan (plans/level-2.plan).
title The gatehouse
spawn 0 1 1
facing 0 0 -1
ambient 0.26
sky 5.0

plan -20 -40
